sequenceDiagram
    participant Garcom
    participant API
    participant DB
    participant Cozinha
    participant Balcao

    Garcom->>API: POST /api/orders {items}
    API->>DB: save Order + OrderItems
    API->>Cozinha: notify new order
    Cozinha->>API: PUT /api/orders/{id}/status?status=PREPARING
    Cozinha->>API: PUT /api/orders/{id}/status?status=READY_FOR_PAYMENT
    Balcao->>API: PUT /api/orders/{id}/status?status=PAID
